   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Maya. I've verified your account and looked at order #8101 from Saffron Lane.\n\n- **Promised:** 6:15 PM\n- **Picked up:** 6:40 PM\n- **Delivered:** 7:07 PM\n\nThat's 52 minutes past the promised time, so the order qualifies for late-delivery compensation. Because it was more than 45 minutes late, I've added a **$15.00 account credit** to your Forkful account. The credit is usable on future orders, and your balance is now $15.00.\n\nI can't refund late-delivery compensation to your card. Is there anything else I can help with?"
