  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry the pad thai was missing from order #8102. I checked the order and the restaurant, and there were no open issues with Lotus Garden. Your report is within the 48-hour window.\n\nI've refunded **$13.50**, the price of the pad thai, to your Visa ending in 4242. It should arrive in 3 to 5 business days.\n\nI normally offer account credit for missing items instead, but that would be $16.20 (the price plus 20%). That would take your credit for this conversation past the $25 limit, so the refund to your card was the option available.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
