   "text": "Oh, I see. I did say account credit would be fine for the pad thai, since I order a lot, so I'd have preferred that. But I get that the card refund is what you can do, so I'll take it.\n\nThanks for sorting both of these out. That's all I needed."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Maya. To recap:\n\n- **Order #8101 (Saffron Lane):** $15.00 account credit for the late delivery.\n- **Order #8102 (Lotus Garden):** $13.50 refund for the pad thai to your Visa ending in 4242, arriving in 3 to 5 business days.\n\nEnjoy your next meal from Forkful!"
